{"type":"META","ticket":2366,"id":"META"}||{"title":"CH213K","tags":["电源管理","理想二极管/ORing控制器"],"source":"11b7ac3f768147c385e38e3b17254086|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","images":["https://alimg.szlcsc.com/upload/public/product/middle/20250524/5C3C929125BF35B30EC80B006F6A70E3.jpg"],"attributes":{"LCSC Part Name":"5V*0.5A低压降二极管芯片","Supplier Part":"C5456874","Manufacturer":"WCH(南京沁恒)","Manufacturer Part":"CH213K","Supplier Footprint":"SOT-23-3","JLCPCB Part Class":"Extended Part","Datasheet":"https://item.szlcsc.com/datasheet/CH213K/6369803.html","Supplier":"LCSC","Add into BOM":"yes","Convert to PCB":"yes","Symbol":"f7670834edbeb662","Designator":"U?","Footprint":"1cd3bcdd0e4f7828","3D Model":"89cb27a44ab2466697082bb9fd73a7d0|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","3D Model Title":"SOT-23-3L_L2.9-W1.6-H1.1-LS2.8-P0.95","3D Model Transform":"114.173,110.236,0,90,0,0,0,0,0","Input Voltage (Vin)":"2.2V~5.5V","Continuous Current (Imax)":"1A","FET Type":"内置FET","Number of Channels":"1","Voltage - Forward(Vf)":"240mV","RDS(on)":"240mΩ","Quiescent Current":"3.6uA","Operating Temperature":"-40℃~+85℃","Features":"过温保护；反向极性保护；短路保护；反向电流阻断","Name":"={Manufacturer Part}","Description":"CH213是一款具有限流功能的低压差理想二极管芯片。该芯片集成了过流保护、短路保护、过温保护、电源极性保护等模块。它支持5V电压下电流不超过1A的直流应用，当VO输出端出现短路等过流情况时，可通过限制输出电流来保护电源系统；当输入电源极性接反时，可保护VO输出端的负载电路","SymbolName":"{\"name\":\"CH213K\",\"uuid\":\"f7670834edbeb662\",\"source\":\"\"}","FootprintName":"{\"name\":\"SOT-23-3_L2.9-W1.6-P1.90-LS2.8-BR\",\"uuid\":\"1cd3bcdd0e4f7828\",\"source\":\"\"}"}}|
